text = "[font_size=20][b][color=SKY_BLUE]New[/color][/b][/font_size]
[ul]
 You can now save while on a tool by pressing ctrl+s as long as the tool supports saving.
 You can now set the order of presets by reordering the preset list (Drag and Drop) on the preset tool window (Remember to save)[/ul]
[font_size=20][b][color=SKY_BLUE]Fixes[/color][/b][/font_size]
[ul] CRITICAL FIX: Fixed an error where the program wouldn't save a list unless you've clicked on creating a new project first
 Fixed an issue where alternate list icons wouldn't load correctly
 Fixed an issue where non-new templates wouldn't save.[/ul]"
